  text: 'Build with GPT-6 Astra. Launch on Product Hunt on September 18.


    We''ve teamed up with @OpenAIDevs for the GPT-6 Astra Challenge. The top five
    launches each win $10K in OpenAI API credits and a year of ChatGPT Pro for up
    to two team members.


    If you’re already building with Astra, this is a chance to share what you’ve made
    and put it in front of a wider audience. You can schedule your launch for Friday,
    September 18.'
